  "recommendedActions": [
    "统一 GSL scheduler eligibility：active/retiring、constant/mcs 均应在 dequeue 前处理当前 geometry/GE/rate availability，避免 shared-server pinning 和 queue-area 缺口。",
    "不要用 time_step 替代 certified recovery；在 packet 仍留队时为 shared GSL server 安排 next geometry/GE/rate/deadline/retirement wake。",
    "MCS snapshot 的 service_rate_bps 只在真实 transmission start 后写入；pre-service waiting 应报告未采样状态。",
    "让 MCS/GE pre-gate probes 进入可审计 counters，或重新定义 effective 使其能表达 mechanism 已通过阻塞行为生效。",
    "ISL zero-rate wait 使用全 ctrl/data queue 的最早 expiry，并与 wake race。",
    "重写两条 GSL gating tests：先显式断言 active/retiring association，再制造 geometry/GE/rate unavailable；加入第二个可服务 endpoint 验证 shared server 不被 pin。",
    "增加 retiring GSL、短 recovery window、snapshot waiting/transmitting、receipt false-negative、mixed control/data expiry、deadline/retirement tie 回归；由本地 Agent 在精确 commit 上运行完整测试。"
